        "core_conclusion": "LLM编码Agent在SWE-Bench花费超60% token寻找文件，CodeGrep通过RL检索Agent降低15-19%轮次与token消耗。",
        "mechanism": "GRPO训练14B检索Agent发多轮grep/glob/read，从67K轨迹挖监督信号。",
